# Parameters for the LOVE20Hub module.
#
# The Hub takes one injected dependency (STAKE_ADDRESS, which lives in addresses.core.params) and derives
# Router / Factory / Launch / MemberNFT / WrappedNative from it. The DEX fee profile is no longer a Hub
# input either: Stake stores it (it needs the same two ratios to predict the pair's `_mintFee`) and the
# Hub copies it at construction, so there is one source of truth.
#
# The two values below are therefore an EXPECTATION, not a setting: the deploy script asserts that Stake
# reports exactly these before broadcasting. They must stay in sync with core.params, which is where the
# profile is actually configured.
#
# Two 1e18 ratios describe the swap fee by where it goes:
#   SWAP_FEE_FOR_LP_RATIO        the part the pair keeps for liquidity providers
#   SWAP_FEE_FOR_PROTOCOL_RATIO  the part the DEX protocol takes out of it (0 = protocol fee disabled)
# The swap fee actually charged is their sum, and it is what the constant-product swap maths uses.
#
# This profile is the local `dex` repository: 0.30% swap fee, protocol fee permanently off (its Factory is
# deployed with `feeToSetter = address(0)`, so `feeTo` can never be set).
SWAP_FEE_FOR_LP_RATIO=3000000000000000
SWAP_FEE_FOR_PROTOCOL_RATIO=0

# Optional cross-check: a token that forms a funded pair with the wrapped native token. The deploy script
# inverts one real `getAmountsOut` quote against this pair and aborts when the recovered swap fee disagrees
# with the two ratios above. Left empty on the local chain because the Hub may be deployed before any pool
# has liquidity; 21_check_hub.sh re-runs the same check when a pair is available.
SWAP_FEE_PROBE_TOKEN=

# Reference profiles for other deployments (not used by this network):
#
#   Uniswap V2          2500000000000000 / 500000000000000   (0.30% total, 1/6 of sqrt(k) growth)
#   PancakeSwap mainnet 1700000000000000 / 800000000000000   (0.25% total: 0.17% LP + 0.08% protocol)
#   PancakeSwap testnet 1500000000000000 / 500000000000000   (0.20% total: 0.15% LP + 0.05% protocol)
